  <data name="chkReencode.ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Converts video to H.264 so Discord shows an inline preview.
HEVC / H.265 sources will NOT preview on Discord without this.
Also makes split sizes very accurate (H.264 has frequent keyframes).
Slightly slower than lossless copy (veryfast preset, CRF 18 quality).</value>
